A METHOD per role on a new GEN 3 page (METHOD P1 P2 P3, the names following the
method). DRUMS: STYLE, EUCLID (Bjorklund per lane, cycles against the bar), CA
(elementary automaton rows, eight rules), POLY (a cycle length per lane). BASS:
FOLLOW, WALK, ARP, DRONE. CHORDS: VOICE, PULSE, ARP. LEAD: CELL, WALK, EUCLID
(with a contour), LSYS. All within the budgets and the key; gen_test checks the
Euclid counts and phase for every (k, n) to 32 and every method of every role.
The track state grows to 96 bytes (store version 2).

