From 568852b1bcda901208b0a64143438acaea947e4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:47:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] GEN: song FORMs: a SONG page with FORM, LEN, GROW and
 TAIL

The chain SONG writes is now a form: CLASSIC (the old starter), POP, AABA,
RISE, ARCH, THROUGH, LOOP, LONG, GROWN (a grammar rewritten GROW times from
the master seed) and CUSTOM (the chain as built in song mode stays, the slots
re-render). LEN halves / doubles the repeats; TAIL adds an INTRO reprise or
PEELs the LEAD then CHORDS off the last section through the song mode's silent
lanes. gen_project_t grows to 24 bytes, version 3 (older stores reinit).
Tests: every form a valid chain, LEN, TAIL, GROWN determinism and seed
dependence, CUSTOM; the SONG page through the panel; a render scene. The
SLICES test resets its marker (the #63 soak now lands on SLICES).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UKiQQaFAeD8B44b8duY1gJ
