From df457031e41d2720260b676eec0e9c7f25624b88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:03:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] GEN UI: named pages, an overview panel, cards that say
 what applies, key feedback

Pages GEN ROLE / GEN SHAPE / HARMONY / GEN METHOD / GEN FORM (the last was
titled SONG, which Felucca's song mode owns). A panel under every GEN page's
cards (GR_GEN): the four tracks' roles and methods with LIVE / LOCK marks,
the sections' ENERGY with the target lit, the selected track's rendered
phrase; on GEN FORM the form as blocks with its row and bar count. Cards
that do not apply (styles on a pitched track, P1-P3 under a role's own
method, GROW off GROWN, an OFF track) show -- and no bar; ENRGY carries its
section letter. Every layer key answers in the header and a key that cannot
act says why; the layer footer reads LOCKS n/m; the SONG dialog names the
form and its bars. Tests and renders updated; docs/gen refreshed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UKiQQaFAeD8B44b8duY1gJ
