From 7a49ceb79e3c3675514b23e231b776a311f7fb10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 21:16:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] GEN UI: glyphs on every key and card, methods drawn as
 themselves, the harmony as keys and chords

29 Fukiai glyphs added to the icon set for GEN (tools/gen_aa_icons.py EXTRA).
The layer's keys show icon + name (the EDIT layer's form), the SEC keys their
section's ENERGY along the cell's foot, the LOCK key an open padlock when it
would unlock. Cards carry icons by meaning (ROLE the role's, METHOD the
method's). The panel's track row shows the roles' glyphs. On GEN METHOD the
sections' row is the method as a picture (Euclid ring, CA generations,
Turing ring, Markov nodes, chaos trace, pink dice, L-system steps, walk,
polymeter cycles, the style grid); on HARMONY it is two octaves of keys with
the scale and the root lit, and the section's four chords as roman degrees.
Six method scenes added to the renders; lint clean; GEN.md and docs/gen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UKiQQaFAeD8B44b8duY1gJ
